==English==

===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|en-us-overdue.ogg|Audio (US)}}
*:Homophones: [[overdo]]

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[late|Late]]; especially, past a [[deadline]] or too late to [[fulfill]] a [[need]].
#:''His library books were three days '''overdue'''.''
#:''My car is '''overdue''' for an oil change.''
#:''He finally left on a long '''overdue''' vacation.''

